    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents dynamics based on mass for living beings or resources. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_mass_based_dynamics" kindref="compound">MassBasedDynamics</ref> is a specialized subclass of <ref refid="class_dynamics" kindref="compound">Dynamics</ref>. Its behavior depends on the mass of the organism or resource it is applied to. This class can be extended to implement specific mass-dependent dynamics. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
